  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="9aad3e96-5c9c-569e-89fb-c435b482086a" activityNameId="cee7449c-13a2-5d86-8586-de288cafc54c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Capacitor, electrolyte type, &lt; 2cm height, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Capacitor, electrolyte type, &lt; 2cm height, at plant
The data represent a typical small electrolyt-capacitor (hight &lt; 2 cm), used in the information and communication technology. Material data are taken from datasheets of producers of such capacitors and from the literature. Infrastructure and production efforts are based on own assumptions. The dataset represents 1 kg of capacitor with a weight of 1.29 gram/unit. In 2023, only production efforts data are updated, which are explained in separate modules. Furthermore, material and energy input are now represented by global inventory flows; UUID: 7b1aff74-0f04-3fe3-9ede-8b410a1d8299
This dataset covers raw material input and production efforts for the production of currently used small (&lt; 2 cm) electrolyt-capacitors.
Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of small electrolyt-capacitors.
Technology: average production of: formulation; build-up process; cutting; bisquing; Pre-Firing; Firing; Tumbling; Termination (SMT) resp. metallization; slitting; winding; metal spray; heat treatment; sawing; lead welding; epoxy filling (THT)
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 
Sampling: literature
Extrapolations: see Geography &amp; Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7b1aff74-0f04-3fe3-9ede-8b410a1d8299.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">GLO</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: Data represent a global valuable composition of small electrolyt-capacitors.</text>
        </comment>
